<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>三代目「武平」 | 子供食堂もある、あたたかい居酒屋</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Shippori+Mincho:wght@400;500;600;800&family=Zen+Kaku+Gothic+New:wght@300;400;500;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ai: #1F3A52;         /* 藍色 - メインダーク */
    --ai-deep: #142839;    /* 濃藍 */
    --kinari: #F4EEE0;     /* 生成り - 背景 */
    --kinari-soft: #EFE7D4;
    --ume: #8A3B49;        /* 梅ワイン - アクセント */
    --ume-deep: #6B2C38;
    --yamabuki: #C99A3A;   /* 山吹 - 差し色 */
    --sumi: #241F1B;       /* 墨 - テキスト */
    --sage: #6E7C5C;       /* 子供食堂セクション用 */
    --line: rgba(36,31,27,0.14);
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--kinari);
    color:var(--sumi);
    font-family:'Zen Kaku Gothic New', sans-serif;
    font-weight:400;
    line-height:1.9;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  h1,h2,h3, .mincho{ font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; }
  a{ color:inherit; text-decoration:none; }
  img{max-width:100%; display:block;}
  .wrap{ max-width:1080px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 28px; }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif;
    font-size:14px;
    letter-spacing:0.32em;
    color:var(--ume);
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;
    margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{ content:""; width:28px; height:1px; background:var(--ume); display:inline-block;}

  /* ---------- ヘッダー ナビ ---------- */
  header{
    position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:100;
    display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
    padding:18px 32px;
    mix-blend-mode:difference;
    color:#F4EEE0;
  }
  header .logo{ font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size:19px; letter-spacing:0.14em; font-weight:600;}
  header nav{ display:flex; gap:28px; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; }
  header nav a{ opacity:0.85; }
  header nav a:hover{ opacity:1; text-decoration:underline; text-underline-offset:5px;}
  @media (max-width: 720px){ header nav{ display:none; } }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    height:100svh;
    min-height:640px;
    display:flex; align-items:flex-end;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 20%, rgba(201,154,58,0.20), transparent 55%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--ai) 0%, var(--ai-deep) 100%);
    color:var(--kinari);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    background-image:
      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(244,238,224,0.045) 0 1px, transparent 1px 84px);
    pointer-events:none;
  }
  .hero-lantern{
    position:absolute; top:-60px; right:8%; width:180px; height:180px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:radial-gradient(circle at 40% 35%, rgba(201,154,58,0.55), rgba(201,154,58,0) 70%);
    filter:blur(4px);
  }
  .hero-inner{ position:relative; z-index:2; width:100%; padding:0 32px 76px; }
  .hero-kicker{
    font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.4em; color:var(--yamabuki);
    margin-bottom:26px; font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif;
  }
  .hero h1{
    font-size:clamp(46px, 9vw, 104px);
    font-weight:600;
    line-height:1.05;
    letter-spacing:0.03em;
  }
  .hero-tagline{
    margin-top:24px; font-size:clamp(15px,2vw,18px);
    font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; letter-spacing:0.08em;
    max-width:34ch; opacity:0.92;
  }
  .hero-cta{ display:flex; gap:16px; margin-top:44px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .btn{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
    padding:15px 30px; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em;
    border:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.5);
    transition:all .35s ease;
  }
  .btn-solid{ background:var(--yamabuki); color:var(--ai-deep); border-color:var(--yamabuki); font-weight:700;}
  .btn-solid:hover{ background:#e0b654; }
  .btn-line:hover{ background:rgba(244,238,224,0.12); border-color:var(--kinari); }
  .hero-scroll{
    position:absolute; right:32px; bottom:28px; z-index:2;
    writing-mode:vertical-rl; font-size:11px; letter-spacing:0.3em; opacity:0.7;
    display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  }
  .hero-scroll::after{ content:""; width:1px; height:52px; background:rgba(244,238,224,0.5); display:block;}

  /* ---------- のれん ディバイダー（シグネチャー要素） ---------- */
  .noren{
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    height:96px;
    background:var(--ume-deep);
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .noren span{
    flex:1;
    border-right:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.16);
    transform:translateY(-100%);
    transition:transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(.16,.9,.28,1);
  }
  .noren.reveal span{ transform:translateY(0); }
  .noren span:nth-child(odd){ transition-delay:.02s; }
  .noren span:nth-child(3n){ transition-delay:.09s; }
  .noren span:nth-child(4n){ transition-delay:.15s; }
  .noren-crest{
    position:absolute; left:50%; top:0; transform:translateX(-50%);
    color:var(--kinari); font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif;
    font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.5em; padding-top:36px; z-index:3;
    opacity:0; transition:opacity 1s ease 0.6s;
  }
  .noren.reveal .noren-crest{ opacity:0.85; }

  /* ---------- セクション共通 ---------- */
  section{ padding:112px 0; position:relative; }
  .section-head{ max-width:640px; margin-bottom:64px; }
  .section-head h2{ font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,42px); font-weight:600; line-height:1.4;}
  .section-head p{ margin-top:18px; font-size:15px; opacity:0.82; max-width:52ch;}

  /* ---------- ABOUT ---------- */
  .about{ background:var(--kinari); }
  .about-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap:64px; align-items:start; }
  .about-lead{ font-size:22px; font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; line-height:2; }
  .about-lead .accent{ color:var(--ume); }
  .about-facts{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .fact{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:20px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); font-size:14px;}
  .fact dt{ letter-spacing:0.14em; opacity:0.6; }
  .fact dd{ font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size:16px; text-align:right;}
  @media (max-width:800px){ .about-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:40px; } }

  /* ---------- MENU ---------- */
  .menu{ background:var(--ai); color:var(--kinari); }
  .menu .eyebrow{ color:var(--yamabuki); }
  .menu .eyebrow::before{ background:var(--yamabuki); }
  .menu-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; background:rgba(244,238,224,0.16); border:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.16); }
  .menu-card{ background:var(--ai); padding:38px 30px; transition:background .4s ease; }
  .menu-card:hover{ background:var(--ai-deep); }
  .menu-card .num{ font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif; font-size:12px; color:var(--yamabuki); letter-spacing:0.2em;}
  .menu-card h3{ font-size:22px; margin:16px 0 12px; font-weight:600;}
  .menu-card p{ font-size:13px; opacity:0.75; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .menu-card ul{ list-style:none; font-size:13px; }
  .menu-card li{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding:7px 0; border-top:1px dashed rgba(244,238,224,0.18);}
  .menu-card li:first-child{ border-top:none; }
  @media (max-width:800px){ .menu-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  .sake-strip{ margin-top:2px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.16); border-top:none;}
  .sake-track{ display:flex; gap:0; animation:scrollx 32s linear infinite; }
  .sake-track span{ white-space:nowrap; padding:16px 34px; font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; border-right:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.14); color:var(--yamabuki);}
  @keyframes scrollx{ from{ transform:translateX(0);} to{ transform:translateX(-50%);} }

  /* ---------- KODOMO SHOKUDO ---------- */
  .kodomo{ background:var(--sage); color:var(--kinari); }
  .kodomo .eyebrow{ color:var(--kinari); }
  .kodomo .eyebrow::before{ background:var(--kinari); }
  .kodomo-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:60px; align-items:center;}
  .kodomo h2{ font-size:clamp(28px,3.6vw,38px); line-height:1.5; }
  .kodomo p.lead{ margin-top:22px; font-size:15px; opacity:0.92; max-width:50ch;}
  .kodomo-card{ background:rgba(244,238,224,0.1); border:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.3); padding:36px; }
  .kodomo-card dl{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:18px; }
  .kodomo-card dt{ font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.18em; opacity:0.8; }
  .kodomo-card dd{ font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size:20px; margin-top:4px;}
  @media (max-width:800px){ .kodomo-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  /* ---------- JOSHIKAI ---------- */
  .joshikai{ background:var(--kinari-soft); }
  .plan-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:28px; }
  .plan-card{ background:var(--kinari); border:1px solid var(--line); padding:36px 28px; position:relative; transition:transform .35s ease, box-shadow .35s ease;}
  .plan-card:hover{ transform:translateY(-6px); box-shadow:0 18px 34px rgba(36,31,27,0.12); }
  .plan-card.featured{ background:var(--ume); color:var(--kinari); border-color:var(--ume); }
  .plan-badge{ position:absolute; top:-1px; right:24px; background:var(--yamabuki); color:var(--ai-deep); font-size:11px; padding:6px 12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; font-weight:700;}
  .plan-card h3{ font-size:19px; margin-bottom:6px; }
  .plan-price{ font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size:30px; margin:14px 0; }
  .plan-price span{ font-size:13px; opacity:0.7; }
  .plan-card ul{ list-style:none; font-size:13px; margin-top:16px; }
  .plan-card li{ padding:6px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
  .plan-card.featured li{ border-top:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.25); }
  @media (max-width:860px){ .plan-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  /* ---------- VOICE ---------- */
  .voice{ background:var(--ai-deep); color:var(--kinari); }
  .voice-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; background:rgba(244,238,224,0.14); border:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.14);}
  .voice-card{ background:var(--ai-deep); padding:34px 28px; }
  .voice-card p{ font-size:14px; opacity:0.88; }
  .voice-card .who{ margin-top:18px; font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size:13px; color:var(--yamabuki); }
  @media (max-width:800px){ .voice-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  /* ---------- ACCESS / FOOTER ---------- */
  .access{ background:var(--kinari); }
  .access-grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:64px; }
  .access dl{ display:flex; flex-direction:column; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }
  .access .fact dd{ text-align:right; }
  .map-box{ background:var(--ai); color:var(--kinari); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; min-height:280px; font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; letter-spacing:0.14em; font-size:14px; text-align:center; padding:20px; border:1px solid var(--line);}
  @media (max-width:800px){ .access-grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  footer{
    background:var(--ai-deep); color:rgba(244,238,224,0.7);
    padding:56px 0 30px; font-size:13px;
  }
  .footer-top{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-end; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:24px; padding-bottom:36px; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(244,238,224,0.14); }
  .footer-logo{ font-family:'Shippori Mincho', serif; font-size:24px; color:var(--kinari); }
  footer .bottom{ display:flex; justify-content:space-between; padding-top:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; opacity:0.6;}

  .fade-up{ opacity:0; transform:translateY(28px); transition:opacity .8s ease, transform .8s ease; }
  .fade-up.show{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation:none !important; transition:none !important; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="logo">三代目「武平」</div>
  <nav>
    <a href="#about">こだわり</a>
    <a href="#menu">メニュー</a>
    <a href="#kodomo">子供食堂</a>
    <a href="#joshikai">女子会プラン</a>
    <a href="#access">アクセス</a>
  </nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-lantern"></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-kicker">SANDAIME BUHEI — つながりの一席</div>
    <h1 class="mincho">三代目「武平」</h1>
    <p class="hero-tagline">美味しい肴と、選び抜いた日本酒。<br>色々な種類のウイスキーも。<br>そしてこの街の子供たちの、もうひとつの食卓。</p>
    <div class="hero-cta">
      <a href="#access" class="btn btn-solid">ご予約はこちら</a>
      <a href="#menu" class="btn btn-line">メニューを見る</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scroll">SCROLL</div>
</section>

<div class="noren" id="noren1">
  <span class="noren-crest">ぶへい</span>
  <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
</div>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head fade-up">
      <div class="eyebrow">CONCEPT</div>
      <h2>暖簾をくぐれば、<br>今日もひとつの食卓になる。</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-grid">
      <p class="about-lead fade-up">
        夜は<span class="accent">こだわりの料理と豊富なお酒</span>を楽しむ酒場として。<br>
        日曜の夕方は<span class="accent">子供食堂</span>として。<br>
        ひとつの厨房が、世代を超えたたくさんの「いただきます」を作っています。
      </p>
      <dl class="about-facts fade-up">
        <div class="fact"><dt>屋号</dt><dd>三代目「武平」</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>営業時間</dt><dd>17:00 〜 24:00（L.O. 23:30）</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>定休日</dt><dd>毎週水曜日</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>子供食堂</dt><dd>毎週日曜 17:00〜19:00</dd></div>
        <div class="fact"><dt>客席</dt><dd>カウンター5席/個室5部屋/大部屋有り</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="noren" id="noren2">
  <span class="noren-crest">武平</span>
  <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
</div>

<section class="menu" id="menu">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head fade-up">
      <div class="eyebrow">MENU</div>
      <h2>肴も、酒も、季節を追いかけて。</h2>
      <p>新鮮な刺身や、こだわりの料理。<br>選べる日本酒とウイスキー</p>
    </div>
    <div class="menu-grid fade-up">
      <div class="menu-card">
        <div class="num">01 / お通し・肴</div>
        <h3>季節の肴</h3>
        <p>その日仕入れた魚と野菜を、炙り・和え・揚げで。</p>
        <ul>
          <li><span>本日の刺身盛り</span><span>¥1,480〜</span></li>
          <li><span>炭火炙り〆鯖</span><span>¥880</span></li>
          <li><span>だし巻き玉子</span><span>¥680</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-card">
        <div class="num">02 / 炭火・鍋</div>
        <h3>炭火焼き・鍋</h3>
        <p>備長炭でじっくり。冬は特製だしの鍋も。</p>
        <ul>
          <li><span>地鶏の炭火串（5本）</span><span>¥1,280</span></li>
          <li><span>もつ鍋（2人前）</span><span>¥2,480</span></li>
          <li><span>野菜の炭火焼き盛り</span><span>¥980</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="menu-card">
        <div class="num">03 / 酒・飲み物</div>
        <h3>日本酒・お酒</h3>
        <p>利き酒師が選ぶ、全国蔵元の一杯。ワイン・梅酒も充実。</p>
        <ul>
          <li><span>利き酒3種セット</span><span>¥1,200</span></li>
          <li><span>季節の梅酒</span><span>¥680〜</span></li>
          <li><span>女将セレクトワイン</span><span>¥780〜</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="sake-strip fade-up">
      <div class="sake-track">
        <span>獺祭</span><span>八海山</span><span>而今</span><span>十四代</span><span>タリスカー</span><span>ザ・マッカラン</span><span>白州</span><span>山崎</span>
        <span>バスカー</span><span>ティーチャーズ</span><span>ザ・マッカラン</span><span>グレンフィディック</span><span>獺祭</span><span>八海山</span><span>而今</span><span>十四代</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="noren" id="noren3">
  <span class="noren-crest">食</span>
  <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
</div>

<section class="kodomo" id="kodomo">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="kodomo-grid">
      <div class="fade-up">
        <div class="eyebrow">KODOMO SHOKUDO</div>
        <h2 class="mincho">毎週日曜日、<br>この店はもうひとつの食卓になる。</h2>
        <p class="lead">お店の営業前の時間を使って、地域の子供たちに無料でごはんを提供しています。夜のお客様が使う食材と同じ厨房から、あたたかい一食を。ひとりで来ても、お友達と来ても大歓迎です。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="kodomo-card fade-up">
        <dl>
          <div><dt>開催日</dt><dd>毎週水曜日 17:00〜19:00</dd></div>
          <div><dt>対象</dt><dd>18歳までのお子様（保護者同伴OK）</dd></div>
          <div><dt>料金</dt><dd>お子様は無料／大人は¥500</dd></div>
          <div><dt>予約</dt><dd>不要・直接お越しください</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="noren" id="noren4">
  <span class="noren-crest">宴</span>
  <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
</div>

<section class="joshikai" id="joshikai">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head fade-up">
      <div class="eyebrow">GIRLS' NIGHT PLAN</div>
      <h2>女子会は、少し華やかに。</h2>
      <p>飲み放題付きのコースから、乾杯スパークリング付きのプランまで。写真映えする一皿もご用意しています。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="plan-grid">
      <div class="plan-card fade-up">
        <h3>ゆるっと女子会</h3>
        <div class="plan-price">¥3,800<span> / 人</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>肴6品＋デザート</li>
          <li>2時間飲み放題</li>
          <li>個室利用可（+¥500）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="plan-card featured fade-up">
        <div class="plan-badge">人気No.1</div>
        <h3>乾杯スパークリング女子会</h3>
        <div class="plan-price">¥4,800<span> / 人</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>乾杯スパークリング付き</li>
          <li>肴8品＋映え盛り合わせ</li>
          <li>2.5時間飲み放題（日本酒込み）</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="plan-card fade-up">
        <h3>利き酒女子会</h3>
        <div class="plan-price">¥5,500<span> / 人</span></div>
        <ul>
          <li>利き酒師によるミニ講座付き</li>
          <li>厳選日本酒5種飲み比べ</li>
          <li>肴7品</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
